   {"q":"There has been a steady erosion in margins across to the book.","a":"There has been a steady erosion of margins across the book. ('erosion of' rege 'of'; 'across' não pede 'to')"},
   {"q":"Our owning of the lanes protects our pricing power.","a":"Our ownership of the lanes protects our pricing power. (a nominalização formal é 'ownership', não o gerúndio 'owning')"},
   {"q":"The board demanded a full appreciate of the trade-offs.","a":"The board demanded a full appreciation of the trade-offs. (após 'a full' exige substantivo 'appreciation')"},
   {"q":"The deterioration on the unit economics went unnoticed.","a":"The deterioration in the unit economics went unnoticed. ('deterioration' colocaciona com 'in', não 'on')"},
