   {"q":"It is considerably more ___ than the way most firms treat it.","a":"strategic"},
   {"q":"A failed delivery is markedly more ___ than a successful one, once recovery is counted.","a":"costly"},
   {"q":"The doorstep interaction is far ___ to the brand than the warehouse ever is.","a":"more important / closer"},
